<title>LATVIA: BALTA INSURANCE EYES 30 PERCENT MARKET SHARE.</title>
<headline>BALTA INSURANCE EYES 30 PERCENT MARKET SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's Balta insurance on Tuesday said that it plans to increase its market share to 30 percent in 1997 from 20 percent and sees gross premiums of 7.03 million lats this year against 6.37 million lats in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to grab about 30 percent of the insurance market against our current 20 percent,&quot; Janis Sprincis, Balta's vice-president, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
